    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Adds an HTML sitemap to easily display your site structure.</p>\n<h3>VO HTML Sitemap, what does it do?</h3>\n<p>This plugin adds an HTML sitemap to your WordPress website. This sitemap allows visitors and search engine crawlers to easily navigate your website structure.</p>\n<h3>Why use an HTML sitemap?</h3>\n<p>An HTML sitemap is a great way to show your website structure to your visitors. It helps them to easily navigate your website. Besides that, it helps search engine crawlers to index your website. This can help to improve your SEO.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Easy to use</li>\n<li>Lightweight</li>\n<li>Simple configuration</li>\n<li>Works out of the box</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How to use</h3>\n<p>After installing the plugin and selecting the page where you want to display the sitemap in the plugins settings, flush the permalinks. You can do this by going to the permalinks settings page and clicking the save button.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Adds an HTML sitemap to easily display your site structure.",
